Assuming these weapons are close to there D&D counterparts, the Sunsword is
great for slaying undead.  It might also act as a light source, I've never
gotten it.  As for the Vorpal Blade, this is a fun one.  It will give you
a small chance to decapitate a humanoid enemy, thereby killing it.  Nice
thing to have if you don't have one of the artifacts.

